    "title": "Bishop Heelan pitcher Kaleb LaFavor off to Boston - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alexander Huddleston Maren Ewertz ,\n1 days ago\nSIOUX CITY , Iowa ( KCAU ) — Some big news as Bishop Heelan pitcher Kaleb LaFavor is now confirmed to have chosen the path to the MLB! He took the flight out to Boston on Wednesday morning.\nLaFavor’s mother posted a video on Facebook of the newest Boston Red Sox pitcher walking through the airport terminal on his way to his future home with a heartfelt caption that ended by saying “Dreams really do come true!”\nIf you would like to check out that full post, click here .\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KCAU 9 News | Sioux City, IA | News, Weather, and Sports.",
